## Specification Reference

### WHATWG WebSockets - Message Event

When a WebSocket message is received, fire a MessageEvent with:
- `data`: The message data (string for text, Blob/ArrayBuffer for binary)
- `origin`: The serialization of the WebSocket URL's origin
- `lastEventId`: Empty string (not used by WebSocket)
- `source`: null (not used by WebSocket)
- `ports`: Empty frozen array (not used by WebSocket)

