1. Define FrameHeader struct with all fields
2. Implement parseFrameHeader() function
3. Handle all three payload length encodings (7-bit, 16-bit, 64-bit)
4. Validate control frame constraints (≤125 bytes, not fragmented)
5. Validate RSV bits (error if set without extensions)
6. Validate masking direction (client→server: must mask, server→client: must not)
