## Serialization (Structured Clone)

Per spec, Blob is Serializable. Need to implement:
- serialization steps: serialize snapshot state and byte sequence
- deserialization steps: restore from serialized data

```zig
pub fn serialize(instance: *runtime.Instance, serialized: *SerializedData) !void {
    const internal = getInternal(instance) orelse return error.InvalidState;
    serialized.snapshot_state = internal.blob_data.snapshot_state;
    serialized.byte_sequence = internal.blob_data.bytes;
    serialized.mime_type = internal.blob_data.mime_type;
}

pub fn deserialize(serialized: *const SerializedData, value: *runtime.Instance) !void {
    // Restore blob from serialized data
    const blob_data = try BlobData.init(
        value.allocator,
        serialized.byte_sequence,
        serialized.mime_type,
    );
    blob_data.snapshot_state = serialized.snapshot_state;
    // ... set internal state
}
