## WebIDL Note on USVString
Per WebIDL spec, USVString replaces unpaired surrogates with U+FFFD. Since we're working in Zig with UTF-8, the JS runtime should have already done this conversion. However, we should validate UTF-8 and handle any invalid sequences.

