```

### Thread Safety Analysis

| Operation | Thread | Protection |
|-----------|--------|------------|
| getInstance() | Any | Singleton pattern with null check |
| enqueue() | Main | Mutex on queue |
| processRequest() | GC Thread | No shared state |
| resolvePromise | Main | Called via scheduleOnMainThread |

### Memory Management

| Allocation | Owner | Freed By |
|------------|-------|----------|
| GCThread | Singleton | shutdown() |
| GCRequest (in queue) | Queue | processRequest removes |
| MainThreadCallbackData | processRequest | resolvePromiseOnMainThread |
| Promise handle | Engine | Engine GC |

